      en: ["The statue stands 13.35 meters tall and weighs 93 metric tons.", "It was cast in 1252 under the direction of sculptor Ono Gorōemon.", "The original wooden hall housing the statue was destroyed by a storm in 1334.", "The 1923 Great Kanto earthquake caused minimal damage to the statue.", "The bronze alloy contains over 90% copper.", "Approximately 1.2 million visitors come to Kotoku-in annually."],
